OL,3,AWhat happened in the failed execution
OL,4,Aof Christa Pike - and what next?
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS convicted murderer Christa Pike is
OL,7,Fin "critical condition, receiving
OL,8,Flife-saving care" at hospital after
OL,9,FTennessee authorities failed to execute
OL,10,Fher by lethal injection, her lawyer
OL,11,Fsays.
OL,13,FThe case of Pike, whose attempted
OL,14,Fexecution had already been the subject
OL,15,Fof a high-profile legal battle, has
OL,16,Fraised a number of questions.
OL,18,FThese include what went wrong, what
OL,19,Fhappens next, and - for opponents of
OL,20,Fthe death penalty - fresh concerns
OL,21,Faround the suffering of an inmate when
OL,22,Fan execution does not go to plan.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
